    {
      "$comment": "The nav link's two raised states, which are one pairing: hover has painted sidebar-fg on sidebar-accent since the sidebar family was wired, and the active route joined it when its brand fill moved to neutral. It went undeclared through both, and the gap had teeth — the version of the active rule that kept accent ink on the same wash measured 4.07:1 in dark and 4.36 in twilight, and only the axe lane caught it, per specimen, at the end of a 26-minute run. Declared here it is arithmetic over five themes instead.",
