      "bg": "--color-neutral-50",
      "layer": "primitive"
    },
    {
      "$comment": "A Meter's fill against its track, which is the graphical object SC 1.4.11 asks 3:1 of: the fill's extent IS the value, and a fill that blends into its track is a bar that says nothing. Four pairings for the four fills the sheet paints — the unbanded accent and the three band tones — each against the one track they sit in. The track itself is not held against the page: it is a recess whose end the printed value makes redundant, and WCAG sets no ratio for that. The fill is --color-fg-accent rather than --color-brand-primary on purpose, and this file is where that choice is enforced: the brand fill measures 1.98 to 2.66 against this track in the three dark themes, because it is a surface for light text rather than a mark on the app's own ground.",
      "id": "meter-fill-on-track",
      "label": "a meter's fill against its track",
      "fg": "--color-fg-accent",
      "bg": "--color-bg-inset",
      "layer": "semantic"
    },
    {
      "$comment": "A status column's dot (ADR 0169 §5), the graphical object SC 1.4.11 asks 3:1 of: it is the column's tone at a glance, and the text beside it is the word. Four pairings for the four toned dots; the neutral dot is the subtle ink, which the text pairing subtle-on-surface already holds to more than this.",
      "id": "status-dot-info-on-surface",
      "label": "a info status dot in a collection's cell, against the surface",
      "fg": "--color-status-info",
      "bg": "--color-bg-surface",
      "layer": "semantic"
    },
    {
      "id": "status-dot-success-on-surface",
      "label": "a success status dot in a collection's cell, against the surface",
      "fg": "--color-status-success",
      "bg": "--color-bg-surface",
      "layer": "semantic"
    },
    {
      "id": "status-dot-warning-on-surface",
      "label": "a warning status dot in a collection's cell, against the surface",
      "fg": "--color-status-warning",
      "bg": "--color-bg-surface",
      "layer": "semantic"
    },
    {
      "id": "status-dot-danger-on-surface",
      "label": "a danger status dot in a collection's cell, against the surface",
      "fg": "--color-status-danger",
      "bg": "--color-bg-surface",
      "layer": "semantic"
    },
